# BestTake Plus

Canonical spec: `BESTTAKE_PLUS.md`. $9.99 once, Family Sharing on, no subscription. One unlock.

Do not invent extra paywalls, subscriptions, or a second lock on Learn, Balance, or characters.

## Never lock

Compare, recording, live tuner, hands-free, opening a shared routine. Also always free: metronome, drone, playback, best take, Learn, sharing a routine, Staff Jumper basic play.

## Caps (free)

- Multitrack: 4 boxes. Plus unlocks 5–12 plus extra boxes.
- Routines: 3 saved. Shared routines still open. Plus is unlimited.
- Vault: 30 takes. Delete to make room. Never cut off a take in progress. Plus is unlimited.

Hitting a cap: keep what they have, allow delete, one upgrade prompt, no auto-delete.

## Pitch Insights

Free still records in the background. Plus unlocks the screen; history is already there.

## Staff Jumper

Free: play, majors C G F D Bb Eb, 1 octave, easy and medium.
Plus: other majors, minors, custom scale, 2 octaves, hard.
